@startuml components
title Sleep Health Research - UML Component Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Research Analyst" as Analyst

package "Presentation" {
  component Streamlit
}

package "Orchestration (LangGraph)" {
  interface "IWorkflow" as IW
  component "LangGraph router" as Router
  component "Scope Reply" as Scope
}

package "Agent layer" {
  interface "IResearch" as IR
  component "Research worker" as Research
  interface "IReflection" as IF
  component "Reflective worker" as Reflect
}

package "Tool layer" {
  interface "IRetrieval" as IRT
  component "LangChain RAG tool" as RAG
  interface "IVectorSearch" as IV
  database ChromaDB
  interface "IFeedbackLog" as IL
  component "Feedback logger" as Logger
  database "JSON logs" as Logs
}

cloud "Groq LLM" as LLM

' Interfaces provided by each component
IW - Router
IR - Research
IF - Reflect
IRT - RAG
IV - ChromaDB
IL - Logger

' Connections with data labels
Analyst --> Streamlit : Health inquiry
Streamlit ..> IW : Question
Router ..> IR : Supported question\n(+ reviewer instructions\non revision)
Research ..> IRT : Search query
RAG ..> IV : Vector search
ChromaDB --> RAG : Relevant passages
RAG --> Research : Evidence + source IDs
Research ..> LLM : Prompt / tool results
Research ..> IF : Draft + evidence
Reflect --> Router : Review: claims, gaps,\ninstructions
Router ..> Scope : Out-of-scope question
Scope --> Router : Scope message
Router ..> IL : Final state + trace
Logger --> Logs : run-*.json
Router --> Streamlit : Verdict, answer, limits

' Component responsibilities
note bottom of Router
  Planner / Router
  select(): scope decision
  route_after_review(): publish,
  revise once, or report limits
end note

note top of Research
  Research Worker (research_agent.py)
  LLM chooses the query, calls the tool
  and writes a cited summary; on revision
  follows the reviewer's instructions.
end note

note bottom of Reflect
  Reflective Worker (reflect_agent.py)
  Checks each claim's citation and
  support; returns gaps with one
  instruction each. Does not route.
end note

note bottom of ChromaDB
  Collection: cdc_sleep_v1
  Four curated CDC passages
  Binary keyword vectors
  In-memory storage
end note

note bottom of Logs
  schemas/feedback_log.schema.json
  exchanges, feedback, outcome
end note

@enduml
